#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:2
msgid "Morpheus DB Migration"
msgstr "Morpheus DB Migration"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:4
msgid ""
"If your new installation is part of a migration or you need to move the "
"data from your original Morpheus database, this is easily accomplished by"
" using a stateful dump."
msgstr ""
"If your new installation is part of a migration o you necesita move the "
"data desde your original Morpheus database, this is easily accomplished by "
"using a stateful dump."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:6
msgid "To begin this, stop the Morpheus UI on your original Morpheus server:"
msgstr "To begin this, stop the Morpheus UI on your original Morpheus server:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:8
msgid "[root@app-server-old ~] morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr "[root@app-server-old ~] morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:12
msgid ""
"Once this is done you can safely export. To access the MySQL shell we "
"will need the password for the Morpheus DB user. We can find this in the "
"morpheus-secrets file:"
msgstr ""
"Once this is done you can safely export. To access the MySQL shell we will "
"need the password for the Morpheus DB user. We can find this in the "
"morpheus-secrets file:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:14
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-old ~] cat /etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json | grep "
"morpheus_password\n"
"\"morpheus_password\": \"451e122cr5d122asw3de5e1b\", <---------------this"
" one\n"
"\"morpheus_password\": \"9b5vdj4de5awf87d\","
msgstr ""
"[root@app-server-old ~] cat /etc/morpheus/morpheus-secrets.json | grep "
"morpheus_password\\n\\\"morpheus_password\\\": "
"\\\"451e122cr5d122asw3de5e1b\\\", <---------------this "
"one\\n\\\"morpheus_password\\\": \\\"9b5vdj4de5awf87d\\\","

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:20
msgid ""
"Take note of the first ``morpheus_password`` as it will be used to invoke"
" a dump. Morpheus provides embedded binaries for this task. Invoke it via"
" the embedded path and specify the host. In this example we are using the"
" morpheus database on the MySQL listening on localhost. Enter the "
"password copied from the previous step when prompted:"
msgstr ""
"Take note of the first ``morpheus_password`` as it se utilizará to invoke "
"a dump. Morpheus proporciona embedded binaries for this task. Invoke it "
"via the embedded path y specify el host. In this example we are using the "
"morpheus database on the MySQL listening on localhost. Enter the password "
"copied desde the previous step when prompted:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:22
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-old ~] /opt/morpheus/embedded/mysql/bin/mysqldump -u "
"morpheus -h 127.0.0.1 morpheus -p > /tmp/morpheus_backup.sql\n"
"Enter password:"
msgstr ""
"[root@app-server-old ~] /opt/morpheus/embedded/mysql/bin/mysqldump -u "
"morpheus -h 127.0.0.1 morpheus -p > /tmp/morpheus_backup.sql\\nEnter "
"password:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:28
msgid ""
"This file needs to be pushed to the new Morpheus Installation's backend. "
"Depending on the GRANTS in the new MySQL backend, this will likely "
"require moving this file to one of the new Morpheus frontend servers."
msgstr ""
"This file necesita ser pushed to the nuevo Morpheus Installation's "
"backend. Dependiendo de the GRANTS in the nuevo MySQL backend, this will "
"likely require moving this file to one of the nuevo Morpheus frontend "
"servers."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:30
msgid ""
"Once the file is in place it can be imported into the backend. Begin by "
"ensuring the Morpheus UI service is stopped on all of the application "
"servers:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el file is in place it puede ser imported en the backend. "
"Begin by ensuring the Morpheus UI service is stopped on todos of the "
"application servers:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:32
msgid "[root@app-server-new ~] morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr "[root@app-server-new ~] morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:36
msgid ""
"Then you can import the MySQL dump into the target database using the "
"embedded MySQL binaries, specifying the database host, and entering the "
"password for the morpheus user when prompted:"
msgstr ""
"Then you can import the MySQL dump en el objetivo database using the "
"embedded MySQL binaries, specifying la base de datos host, y entering the "
"password for the morpheus user when prompted:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:38
msgid ""
"[root@app-server-new ~] /opt/morpheus/embedded/mysql/bin/mysql -u "
"morpheus -h 127.0.0.1 morpheus -p < /tmp/morpheus_backup.sql\n"
"Enter password:"
msgstr ""
"[root@app-server-new ~] /opt/morpheus/embedded/mysql/bin/mysql -u morpheus "
"-h 127.0.0.1 morpheus -p < /tmp/morpheus_backup.sql\\nEnter password:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:43
msgid ""
"The data from the old appliance is now replicated on the new appliance. "
"Simply start the UI to complete the process:"
msgstr ""
"The data desde the old appliance is now replicated on the nuevo appliance. "
"Simply start the UI to complete el proceso:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:45
msgid "[root@app-server-new ~] morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr "[root@app-server-new ~] morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:49
msgid ""
"With the migration complete, you will also need to update the stored "
"password for the appliance backup job as the destination appliance will "
"have a different dynamically-generated MySQL password. We can update that"
" password value by altering the backup directly in the |morpheus| "
"database."
msgstr ""
"With the migration complete, you will también need para actualizar the "
"stored password for el appliance backup job as the destination appliance "
"will have a diferente dynamically-generated MySQL password. We can update "
"that password value by altering the backup directly in the |morpheus| "
"database."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:51
msgid ""
"select * from backup where `name` ='Morpheus Appliance';\n"
"UPDATE `morpheus`.`backup` SET `ssh_host` = '127.0.0.1', "
"`target_password` = 'its-a-secret' WHERE `id` = '1';"
msgstr ""
"select * desde backup where `name` ='Morpheus Appliance';\\nUPDATE "
"`morpheus`.`backup` SET `ssh_host` = '127.0.0.1', `target_password` = "
"'its-a-secret' WHERE `id` = '1';"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:56
msgid ""
"After the migration it is important to reset the unique ID of the "
"Morpheus Appliance. This will ensure your new installation will "
"communicate correctly with the Morpheus Hub."
msgstr ""
"Después del migration it is important to reset the unique ID of the "
"Morpheus Appliance. This will ensure your nuevo installation will "
"communicate correctly con the Morpheus Hub."

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:58
msgid ""
"The final step is to generate a new unique ID for the Morpheus Appliance."
" Firstly run the following SQL command on the database for the new "
"installation:"
msgstr ""
"The final step is to generate a nuevo unique ID for the Morpheus "
"Appliance. Firstly ejecute lo siguiente SQL command on la base de datos "
"for the nuevo installation:"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:60
msgid "UPDATE appliance_instance SET hub_unique_id = NULL;"
msgstr "UPDATE appliance_instance SET hub_unique_id = NULL;"

#: ../../getting_started/maintenance/db_migration.rst:64
msgid ""
"Secondly, re-apply your Morpheus license key within the Morpheus UI via "
"the \"Upgrade A License\" action within Administration -> Settings -> "
"License"
msgstr ""
"Secondly, re-apply your Morpheus license key dentro de the Morpheus UI via "
"the \"Upgrade A License\" action dentro de Administration -> Settings -> "
"License"

